  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Androecium"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The androecium is made of stamens, each with a filament and an anther. Stamens attached to petals are epipetalous, as in brinjal; attached to the perianth they are epiphyllous, as in lily. Stamens may be free (polyandrous) or united: in one bundle, monoadelphous, as in China rose; in two bundles, diadelphous, as in pea; in more than two bundles, polyadelphous, as in Citrus.",
    "kn": "ಪುಂಕೇಸರಗಳು ದಳಕ್ಕೆ ಅಂಟಿದರೆ ದಳಾಸಕ್ತ (ಬದನೆ), ಪುಷ್ಪಪತ್ರಕ್ಕೆ ಅಂಟಿದರೆ ಪರಿದಳಾಸಕ್ತ (ಲಿಲಿ). ಒಂದು ಕಟ್ಟು: ದಾಸವಾಳ; ಎರಡು ಕಟ್ಟು: ಬಟಾಣಿ; ಹಲವು ಕಟ್ಟು: ನಿಂಬೆ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Epipetalous: brinjal; epiphyllous: lily"
    },
    {
     "en": "Monoadelphous: China rose"
    },
    {
     "en": "Diadelphous: pea; polyadelphous: Citrus"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "The androecium is made of stamens, each with a filament and an anther. Stamens attached to petals are epipetalous, as in brinjal; attached to the perianth they are epiphyllous, as in lily. Stamens may be free (polyandrous) or united: in one bundle, monoadelphous, as in China rose; in two bundles, diadelphous, as in pea; in more than two bundles, polyadelphous, as in Citrus.",
