  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Gynoecium"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The gynoecium is made of one or more carpels, each with a stigma, style and ovary. If the carpels are free it is apocarpous, as in lotus and rose; if fused, syncarpous, as in mustard and tomato. After fertilisation the ovules become seeds and the ovary becomes the fruit.",
    "kn": "ಶಲಾಕೆಗಳು ಪ್ರತ್ಯೇಕವಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ ವಿಯುಕ್ತ ಶಲಾಕಾ (ಕಮಲ, ಗುಲಾಬಿ); ಕೂಡಿದ್ದರೆ ಸಂಯುಕ್ತ ಶಲಾಕಾ (ಸಾಸಿವೆ, ಟೊಮೆಟೊ). ಫಲೀಕರಣದ ನಂತರ ಅಂಡಕ ಬೀಜವಾಗುತ್ತದೆ, ಅಂಡಾಶಯ ಹಣ್ಣಾಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   },
